Major modifications in this fork:

- Public demo that runs with only ZENMUX_API_KEY. Login, credits, payments, sponsor placement, TokenPay, Watcha OAuth/pay, and Stripe are disabled.
- SEO, landing, guide, and model marketing pages are removed. The home page opens game setup.
- Built-in player models, summaries, reviews, and character generation use a ZenMux-only pool: deepseek/deepseek-v3.2, google/gemini-3.5-flash-lite, and minimax/minimax-m2.1.
- Server-side limit of DAILY_GAME_LIMIT games per IP per Singapore calendar day (default 3), plus a per-game cap on LLM calls. RATE_LIMIT_BYPASS_TOKEN can skip only the daily cap.
- Temporary brand (name, logo, favicon, Open Graph image, CC0 BGM).
- First-layer prompt-injection guard on player speech serialized into model prompts.
- Phase bar that does not reveal which night role is acting unless it is the human's own turn.

